{"story":{"id":"story-069125d7f5c143d1","title":{"zh":"星球被击碎","en":"World Cracked"},"category":"stories","image":"art/43de025c76c560c952b7.webp","start":"planet_destruction.101","chapters":7,"nodes":13,"visible":true,"excerpt":{"zh":"随着巨像完成其毁天灭地的任务，[From.From.GetName]因受到[From.GetName]地壳破裂与磁层分解的猛烈冲击而产生的微微晃动也平息了下来。\n\n我们很难理解一颗星球死亡时的那种壮烈，但[From.GetName]炽热的核心在冰冷宇宙中冷却时的那种死亡之美是无可争辩的。","en":"The [From.From.GetName]'s gentle rocking - buffeted by [From.GetName]'s rupturing crust and unraveling magnetosphere - subsides as the Colossus completes its cataclysmic task.\n\nThe sheer violence of a dying planet is difficult to comprehend, but the funereal b"},"navigation":{"order":["planet_destruction.101","planet_destruction.102","planet_destruction.210","planet_destruction.301","planet_destruction.701","planet_destruction.801","planet_destruction.1000"],"tree":[{"id":"planet_destruction.101","parent":null,"depth":0,"kind":"reading","label":{"zh":"","en":""}},{"id":"planet_destruction.102","parent":"planet_destruction.101","depth":0,"kind":"reading","label":{"zh":"","en":""}},{"id":"planet_destruction.210","parent":"planet_destruction.102","depth":0,"kind":"reading","label":{"zh":"","en":""}},{"id":"planet_destruction.301","parent":"planet_destruction.210","depth":0,"kind":"reading","label":{"zh":"","en":""}},{"id":"planet_destruction.701","parent":"planet_destruction.301","depth":0,"kind":"reading","label":{"zh":"","en":""}},{"id":"planet_destruction.801","parent":"planet_destruction.701","depth":0,"kind":"reading","label":{"zh":"","en":""}},{"id":"planet_destruction.1000","parent":"planet_destruction.801","depth":0,"kind":"reading","label":{"zh":"","en":""}}],"links":[]}},"chapters":[{"id":"planet_destruction.101","title":{"zh":"星球被击碎","en":"World Cracked"},"texts":[{"zh":"随着巨像完成其毁天灭地的任务，[From.From.GetName]因受到[From.GetName]地壳破裂与磁层分解的猛烈冲击而产生的微微晃动也平息了下来。\n\n我们很难理解一颗星球死亡时的那种壮烈，但[From.GetName]炽热的核心在冰冷宇宙中冷却时的那种死亡之美是无可争辩的。","en":"The [From.From.GetName]'s gentle rocking - buffeted by [From.GetName]'s rupturing crust and unraveling magnetosphere - subsides as the Colossus completes its cataclysmic task.\n\nThe sheer violence of a dying planet is difficult to comprehend, but the funereal beauty of [From.GetName]'s molten core cooling in gelid space is undeniable."}],"variants":false,"sections":[],"image":"art/43de025c76c560c952b7.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"label":{"zh":"确认","en":"OK"},"conditional":true,"next":[]},{"label":{"zh":"非常棒。","en":"Glorious."},"conditional":true,"next":[]}],"next":[],"readings":[{"label":{"zh":"通常","en":"Default"},"textIndices":[0],"choiceIndices":[]},{"label":{"zh":"其他文明","en":"Other civilizations"},"textIndices":[0],"choiceIndices":[0]},{"label":{"zh":"种族洁癖","en":"Fanatic Purifiers"},"textIndices":[0],"choiceIndices":[1]},{"label":{"zh":"铁心灭绝者","en":"Determined Exterminator"},"textIndices":[0],"choiceIndices":[1]}]},{"id":"planet_destruction.102","title":{"zh":"炸个球助兴","en":"Cracking Open a Cold One"},"texts":[{"zh":"随着巨像完成其毁天灭地的任务，[From.From.GetName]因受到[From.GetName]地壳破裂与磁层分解的猛烈冲击而产生的微微晃动也平息了下来。\n\n我们很难理解一颗星球死亡时的那种壮烈，但[From.GetName]炽热的核心在冰冷宇宙中冷却时的那种死亡之美是无可争辩的。","en":"The [From.From.GetName]'s gentle rocking - buffeted by [From.GetName]'s rupturing crust and unraveling magnetosphere - subsides as the Colossus completes its cataclysmic task.\n\nThe sheer violence of a dying planet is difficult to comprehend, but the funereal beauty of [From.GetName]'s molten core cooling in gelid space is undeniable."}],"variants":false,"sections":[],"image":"art/43de025c76c560c952b7.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"label":{"zh":"确认","en":"OK"},"conditional":true,"next":[]},{"label":{"zh":"非常棒。","en":"Glorious."},"conditional":true,"next":[]}],"next":[],"readings":[{"label":{"zh":"通常","en":"Default"},"textIndices":[0],"choiceIndices":[]},{"label":{"zh":"其他文明","en":"Other civilizations"},"textIndices":[0],"choiceIndices":[0]},{"label":{"zh":"种族洁癖","en":"Fanatic Purifiers"},"textIndices":[0],"choiceIndices":[1]},{"label":{"zh":"铁心灭绝者","en":"Determined Exterminator"},"textIndices":[0],"choiceIndices":[1]}]},{"id":"planet_destruction.210","title":{"zh":"[From.GetName]被屏蔽","en":"[From.GetName] Shielded"},"texts":[{"zh":"从[From.From.GetName]发出的耀眼光束逐渐暗淡，[From.GetName]寂静无声。\n\n也许历史会将这次屏蔽，这次将[From.GetName]从大宇宙完全隔离的行为，视作极端且不合理。也许也不会。不管如何，从现在起[From.GetStarName]星系有了一颗行星规模的水晶球。","en":"The glittering beam from the [From.From.GetName] fades, and [From.GetName] is silent.\n\nPerhaps history will call the shielding, this complete severing of [From.GetName] from the greater cosmos, extreme and unjustified. Or perhaps not. For now, the [From.GetStarName] system has a new planetary terrarium."},{"zh":"[From.From.GetName]炫目的光芒已渐渐黯淡，[From.GetName]归于沉寂。\n\n生活将在封闭的世界中继续。","en":"The glittering beam from the [From.From.GetName] fades, and [From.GetName] is silent.\n\nLife goes on, if contained."}],"variants":true,"sections":[],"image":"art/ce799187ebb15e344ce6.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"label":{"zh":"轻按玻璃看他们蠕动。","en":"Tap on the glass and watch them squirm."},"conditional":true,"next":[]},{"label":{"zh":"必要的恶。","en":"A necessary evil."},"conditional":true,"next":[]}],"next":[],"readings":[{"label":{"zh":"其他文明","en":"Other civilizations"},"textIndices":[0],"choiceIndices":[0]},{"label":{"zh":"和平主义","en":"Pacifist"},"textIndices":[1],"choiceIndices":[1]},{"label":{"zh":"和平主义 · 平等主义","en":"Pacifist · Egalitarian"},"textIndices":[1],"choiceIndices":[1]},{"label":{"zh":"平等主义","en":"Egalitarian"},"textIndices":[1],"choiceIndices":[1]},{"label":{"zh":"平等主义 · 和平主义","en":"Egalitarian · Pacifist"},"textIndices":[1],"choiceIndices":[1]}]},{"id":"planet_destruction.301","title":{"zh":"中子灭杀","en":"Neutron Swept"},"texts":[{"zh":"[From.GetName]地表上的灭杀完成后，[From.From.GetName]上的中子羽流逐渐散去了。扫描显示未发现智慧生命迹象；植被虽被摧毁，但会逐渐恢复的。有些人会称这种彻底消灭智慧生命，只保留无机质的做法为邪恶的战争罪行。\n\n我们将其称为高效。","en":"The [From.From.GetName]'s neutron plume peters out, having finished its sweep of [From.GetName]'s surface. Scans report no signs of sapient life; plant life, while damaged, may recover in time. Some would call the total annihilation of intelligent life, while preserving inanimate matter, a perverse war crime.\n\nWe would call it efficient."},{"zh":"[From.GetName]表面上的灭杀完成后，[From.From.GetName]上的中子羽流逐渐散去。\n\n声波传感器只传输来风声和合成人的呼声。所有高等有机生命已被扫除。","en":"The [From.From.GetName]'s neutron plume peters out, having finished its sweep of [From.GetName]'s surface.\n\nSonic sensors relay nothing but the wind and the gentle clicks and whirrs of the surviving synthetic populace. All sapient organic life has been wiped out."},{"zh":"完成了对[From.GetName]地表的灭杀之后，[From.From.GetName]的中子羽流渐渐消散。\n\n快速扫描确认了曾遍布地表的扭曲翻腾的有机质，已经彻底失去活性，仅剩贫瘠的石堆。","en":"The [From.From.GetName]'s neutron plume peters out, having finished its sweep of [From.GetName]'s surface.\n\nA quick scan confirms that the infested landscape, previously a roiling and writhing mass of organic activity, is now bereft of all life. Only barren rock remains."}],"variants":true,"sections":[],"image":"art/1a62b642b5ecf10da7e8.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"label":{"zh":"确认","en":"OK"},"conditional":true,"next":[]},{"label":{"zh":"非常棒。","en":"Glorious."},"conditional":true,"next":[]}],"next":[],"readings":[{"label":{"zh":"读法 1","en":"Reading 1"},"textIndices":[0],"choiceIndices":[]},{"label":{"zh":"其他文明 1","en":"Other civilizations 1"},"textIndices":[0],"choiceIndices":[0]},{"label":{"zh":"种族洁癖 1","en":"Fanatic Purifiers 1"},"textIndices":[0],"choiceIndices":[1]},{"label":{"zh":"铁心灭绝者 1","en":"Determined Exterminator 1"},"textIndices":[0],"choiceIndices":[1]},{"label":{"zh":"读法 2","en":"Reading 2"},"textIndices":[1],"choiceIndices":[]},{"label":{"zh":"其他文明 2","en":"Other civilizations 2"},"textIndices":[1],"choiceIndices":[0]},{"label":{"zh":"种族洁癖 2","en":"Fanatic Purifiers 2"},"textIndices":[1],"choiceIndices":[1]},{"label":{"zh":"铁心灭绝者 2","en":"Determined Exterminator 2"},"textIndices":[1],"choiceIndices":[1]},{"label":{"zh":"读法 3","en":"Reading 3"},"textIndices":[2],"choiceIndices":[]},{"label":{"zh":"其他文明 3","en":"Other civilizations 3"},"textIndices":[2],"choiceIndices":[0]},{"label":{"zh":"种族洁癖 3","en":"Fanatic Purifiers 3"},"textIndices":[2],"choiceIndices":[1]},{"label":{"zh":"铁心灭绝者 3","en":"Determined Exterminator 3"},"textIndices":[2],"choiceIndices":[1]}]},{"id":"planet_destruction.701","title":{"zh":"行星已被淹没","en":"Planet Drenched"},"texts":[{"zh":"随着从[FromFrom.GetName]上下降的水柱消散，[From.GetName]的表面完全改变了。曾经有广阔缺水的大陆，现在只有崭新闪耀着欢迎的微光的蓝色海洋，随时可以居住。","en":"As the column of water descending from the [FromFrom.GetName] dissipates, the surface of [From.GetName] is wholly transformed. Where once there were sprawling continents bereft of water, now there is only the welcoming shimmer of pristine, blue ocean ready to be inhabited."}],"variants":false,"sections":[],"image":"art/d966c1f3fb844ef58ca7.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"label":{"zh":"棒极了。","en":"Excellent."},"conditional":false,"next":[]}],"next":[],"readings":[]},{"id":"planet_destruction.801","title":{"zh":"行星被毒化","en":"Planet Toxified"},"texts":[{"zh":"来自[FromFrom.GetName]的滔天毒流渐渐平息，[From.GetName]上生意盎然的生态系统不复存在，充满毒气的星球中唯有少数几种生命形式能繁衍生息。","en":"As the awesome stream of venomous substances from the [FromFrom.GetName] subsides, [From.GetName] is transformed from a vibrant ecosystem to a noxious world on which few forms of life can thrive."}],"variants":false,"sections":[],"image":"art/3d93dc228674c5f4af09.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"label":{"zh":"确认","en":"OK"},"conditional":true,"next":[]},{"label":{"zh":"非常棒。","en":"Glorious."},"conditional":true,"next":[]}],"next":[],"readings":[{"label":{"zh":"通常","en":"Default"},"textIndices":[0],"choiceIndices":[]},{"label":{"zh":"其他文明","en":"Other civilizations"},"textIndices":[0],"choiceIndices":[0]},{"label":{"zh":"种族洁癖","en":"Fanatic Purifiers"},"textIndices":[0],"choiceIndices":[1]},{"label":{"zh":"铁心灭绝者","en":"Determined Exterminator"},"textIndices":[0],"choiceIndices":[1]}]},{"id":"planet_destruction.1000","title":{"zh":"对[From.GetName]的观测终止","en":"Observation of [From.GetName] Ceases"},"texts":[{"zh":"尽管对[GetPreFTLLower]文明使用超级武器非常有趣，但这也意味着那里已经没什么剩下的可供观测了……","en":"Although using our superweapons against a [GetPreFTLLower] civilization is certainly amusing, it also means that there is now nothing left to observe there..."},{"zh":"[FromFrom.Owner.GetName]的部队摧毁了[From.GetName]的[From.GetPlanetMoon]，杀害了滋生在星球表面的[GetPreFTLLower]文明。结果就是，这里已经没什么剩下的可供观测了……","en":"The forces of the [FromFrom.Owner.GetName] have destroyed the [From.GetPlanetMoon] of [From.GetName], killing the [GetPreFTLLower] civilization that flourished on the surface. As a result, there is now nothing left to observe there..."},{"zh":"[FromFrom.Owner.GetName]的部队已经将[From.GetName]包裹在了不可穿透的护盾中，使得我们不可能继续对滋生在星球表面上的[GetPreFTLLower]文明继续进行观测……","en":"The forces of the [FromFrom.Owner.GetName] have encased [From.GetName] in an impenetrable shield, making it impossible for us to continue observing the [GetPreFTLLower] civilization flourishing on the surface..."},{"zh":"[FromFrom.Owner.GetName]的部队已经将滋生在[From.GetName]的[GetPreFTLLower]文明进行了清除。结果，这里已经没什么剩下的可供观测了……","en":"The forces of the [FromFrom.Owner.GetName] have wiped out the [GetPreFTLLower] civilization that flourished on [From.GetName]. As a result, there is now nothing left to observe there..."}],"variants":true,"sections":[],"image":"art/ce799187ebb15e344ce6.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"label":{"zh":"那就这样吧。","en":"So be it."},"conditional":true,"next":[]},{"label":{"zh":"对于那些被飞速转化为等离子体的人来说他们表现的不错。","en":"They flail pretty well for those being flash-converted to plasma."},"conditional":true,"next":[]}],"next":[],"readings":[{"label":{"zh":"读法 1","en":"Reading 1"},"textIndices":[0],"choiceIndices":[]},{"label":{"zh":"其他文明 1","en":"Other civilizations 1"},"textIndices":[0],"choiceIndices":[0]},{"label":{"zh":"读法 2","en":"Reading 2"},"textIndices":[0],"choiceIndices":[0]},{"label":{"zh":"读法 3","en":"Reading 3"},"textIndices":[0],"choiceIndices":[1]},{"label":{"zh":"排外主义 1","en":"Xenophobe 1"},"textIndices":[0],"choiceIndices":[1]},{"label":{"zh":"读法 4","en":"Reading 4"},"textIndices":[1],"choiceIndices":[]},{"label":{"zh":"其他文明 2","en":"Other civilizations 2"},"textIndices":[1],"choiceIndices":[0]},{"label":{"zh":"读法 5","en":"Reading 5"},"textIndices":[1],"choiceIndices":[1]},{"label":{"zh":"排外主义 2","en":"Xenophobe 2"},"textIndices":[1],"choiceIndices":[1]},{"label":{"zh":"读法 6","en":"Reading 6"},"textIndices":[2],"choiceIndices":[]},{"label":{"zh":"其他文明 3","en":"Other civilizations 3"},"textIndices":[2],"choiceIndices":[0]},{"label":{"zh":"读法 7","en":"Reading 7"},"textIndices":[2],"choiceIndices":[0]},{"label":{"zh":"读法 8","en":"Reading 8"},"textIndices":[2],"choiceIndices":[1]},{"label":{"zh":"排外主义 3","en":"Xenophobe 3"},"textIndices":[2],"choiceIndices":[1]},{"label":{"zh":"读法 9","en":"Reading 9"},"textIndices":[3],"choiceIndices":[0]},{"label":{"zh":"其他文明 4","en":"Other civilizations 4"},"textIndices":[3],"choiceIndices":[0]}]},{"id":"planet_destruction.100","title":{"zh":"","en":""},"texts":[],"variants":false,"sections":[],"image":null,"hidden":true,"choices":[],"next":[{"target":"planet_destruction.102","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-069125d7f5c143d1"},{"target":"planet_destruction.101","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-069125d7f5c143d1"},{"target":"planet_destruction.1000","conditional":true,"delayed":true,"kind":"event","story":"story-069125d7f5c143d1"},{"target":"crisis.2037","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"contingency"},{"target":"crisis.2036","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"contingency"},{"target":"crisis.2039","conditional":true,"delayed":true,"kind":"event","story":"contingency"},{"target":"crisis.2480","conditional":true,"delayed":true,"kind":"event","story":"contingency"},{"target":"crisis.2481","conditional":true,"delayed":true,"kind":"event","story":"contingency"},{"target":"crisis.2038","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"